# omarchy-egpu system half
# omarchy-egpu-version: 0.1.0
#
# udev rules for the eGPU (plan-engine.md §10.3). system/install.sh installs
# this as /etc/udev/rules.d/61-omarchy-egpu.rules with the placeholder in the
# primary rule replaced by the PCI address of the boot VGA device it detects
# (this machine: 0000:00:02.0). 61 sorts after systemd's 60-drm.rules, which
# sets ID_PATH, the value /dev/dri/by-path/ names are built from.

ACTION=="remove", GOTO="omarchy_egpu_end"

# Colon-free links for AQ_DRM_DEVICES, which is colon-separated, so the by-path
# names (pci-0000:00:02.0-card) cannot go into it directly (O1). Card nodes
# only: DEVTYPE drm_minor, not the cardN-HDMI-A-1 connectors. Never cardN.
#
#   primary   the card whose by-path name is the boot VGA device's
#   external  a card whose PCI function is display class and removable: no
#             vendor, so any backend; no address, because a tunnelled eGPU's
#             address changes with port and enumeration order
SUBSYSTEM=="drm", KERNEL=="card[0-9]*", ENV{DEVTYPE}=="drm_minor", ENV{ID_PATH}=="pci-@PRIMARY_BDF@", SYMLINK+="dri/omarchy-egpu-primary"
SUBSYSTEM=="drm", KERNEL=="card[0-9]*", ENV{DEVTYPE}=="drm_minor", SUBSYSTEMS=="pci", ATTRS{class}=="0x03[0-9]*", ATTRS{removable}=="removable", SYMLINK+="dri/omarchy-egpu-external"

# Auto-connect: on while /etc/omarchy-egpu/autoconnect exists. install.sh
# creates it on a first install (scope.md DECISION 2026-10-10); the panel's
# Setup switch removes or recreates it through the helper. When on, a removable
# display device appearing loads its backend's KMS modules (nvidia_drm and what
# it needs) through the helper, which refuses anything but an allowlisted
# vendor, and a device the user just ejected (the eject latch). Nothing loads
# nvidia_drm on hot-plug otherwise (O3); the panel's Connect button does it
# then. TEST is evaluated per event, so switching needs no udev reload.
ACTION=="add", SUBSYSTEM=="pci", ATTR{class}=="0x03[0-9]*", ATTR{removable}=="removable", TEST=="/etc/omarchy-egpu/autoconnect", RUN+="/usr/local/bin/omarchy-egpu-admin load auto"

LABEL="omarchy_egpu_end"
